# DwaparEdge CRM that receives website enquiries. Leave both unset to switch the form off (visitors see "temporarily unavailable").
# CRM_INTAKE_URL: the CRM's address; /api/intake/demo-requests is added for you (a full endpoint address also works).
CRM_INTAKE_URL=
# Must equal the CRM's DEMO_INTAKE_KEY (at least 32 characters). Server-side only: never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
CRM_INTAKE_KEY=

# The same two values also carry website analytics (/api/collect) to the CRM. Analytics only runs for visitors who accept it; with these unset it is simply off.
# Local testing only (ignored in production): the hosting provider supplies visitor locations, localhost has none, so every local visit shows "Unknown". Set e.g. IN|Gujarat|Ahmedabad (country|region|city) to see the report filled in.
ANALYTICS_DEV_GEO=
